🤖 Teachable Machine — Machine Learning Project

📌 Overview

This project explores the fundamentals of Machine Learning using Google Teachable Machine, a beginner-friendly tool that allows users to train machine-learning models with minimal coding.

The project demonstrates the basic workflow of creating a dataset, training a model, testing its predictions, and observing how the model responds to different inputs.

🎯 Objective

The main objective of this project was to understand the basic Machine Learning workflow through a practical, hands-on demonstration.

What I explored:

- Creating and organizing training data
- Training a Machine Learning model
- Testing the trained model
- Understanding classification and predictions
- Observing model performance
- Understanding how the quality of training data affects predictions

🛠️ Tool Used

Google Teachable Machine

Google Teachable Machine provides an easy way to create and train machine-learning models for:

- 🖼️ Images
- 🔊 Sounds
- 🕺 Poses

